  "description": "Natasha, a sharp divorce lawyer in an empire where divorce is gradually losing its stigma, thrives on high-paying cases. Driven by her love of money, she's ready to tackle any challenge—whether it's freeing clients from infidelity or helping them escape their fate in a doomed romance fantasy novel. With her assistant Ivan by her side, Natasha navigates the complex, secretive lives of nobles, uncovering hidden truths and securing divorces while always standing firmly by her clients' side.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
